<title>UK: BARCLAYS RAISES BASE LENDING RATE.</title>
<headline>BARCLAYS RAISES BASE LENDING RATE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Barclays Plc said on Thursday it would raise its base lending rate to 7.00 percent from 6.75 percent after the Bank of England announced a quarter point rate rise.</p>
</text>
